+/*
+ * A helper that executes the specified program
+ * with PTRACE_GETSIGINFO failing with ESRCH.
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 The strace developers.
+ * All rights reserved.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
